<section id="comp-mkf0afm8" tabindex="-1" class="Le88gL comp-mkf0afm8 wixui-section"><div id="bgLayers_comp-mkf0afm8" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-mkf0afm8" class="QG9w8P"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LNYVZi ayCf9D"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-mkf0afm8" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-mkf0afm8" class="ROWgFb"></div></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-mkf0afm8inlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-mkf0afm8inlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><section id="comp-mkf0aflp" class="comp-mkf0aflp CeUMmm wixui-column-strip"><div id="bgLayers_comp-mkf0aflp" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-mkf0aflp" class="ktMZav"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="V9k0ll etGVsi"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-mkf0aflp" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-mkf0aflp" class="etSQ9j"></div></div><div data-testid="columns" class="Ak0vpt"><div id="comp-mkf0aflq1" class="comp-mkf0aflq1 FDI5TK wixui-column-strip__column"><div id="bgLayers_comp-mkf0aflq1" data-hook="bgLayers" data-motion-part="BG_LAYER comp-mkf0aflq1" class="QG9w8P"><div data-testid="colorUnderlay" class="LNYVZi ayCf9D"></div><div id="bgMedia_comp-mkf0aflq1" data-motion-part="BG_MEDIA comp-mkf0aflq1" class="ROWgFb"></div></div><div data-mesh-id="comp-mkf0aflq1inlineContent" data-testid="inline-content" class=""><div data-mesh-id="comp-mkf0aflq1inlineContent-gridContainer" data-testid="mesh-container-content"><div id="comp-mkf0aflr" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-mkf0aflr wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><h1 class="font_0 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:56px; line-height:normal;"><span style="letter-spacing:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-size:56px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Prendre rendez-vous</span></span></h1></div><div id="comp-mkf0afm3" class="N8MGzv _v6ohL AWXfZq PO9MfV comp-mkf0afm3 wixui-rich-text" data-testid="richTextElement"><p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:16px; line-height:1.8em;"><span style="font-size:16px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Parfois, on tient longtemps. Et puis un jour, on sent que seul(e), ça devient trop lourd, trop confus, ou trop répétitif. </span></p> <p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:16px; line-height:1.8em;"><span style="font-size:16px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Prendre rendez-vous, c’est choisir de ne plus porter tout ça seul(e).</span><span style="font-size:16px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span></span></p> <p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:16px; line-height:1.8em;"><span style="font-size:16px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Commencer une thérapie, ce n’est pas “aller mal”. C’est un acte de confiance : la confiance de vous autoriser à être accompagné(e), et la gratitude de prendre soin de vous.</span></p> <p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:16px; line-height:1.8em;"><br class="wixui-rich-text__text"> <span style="font-size:16px;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Je vous propose des consultations dans un cadre confidentiel, clair et respectueux. Mon rôle est de vous accompagner avec présence, rigueur et humanité.</span></p></div><div id="comp-mkf37h5n" class="comp-mkf37h5n"><a data-testid="linkElement" href="https://www.psychologue.net/cabinets/elisa-gatay-hauet" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="StylableButton2545352419__root StylableButton2545352419__forcedColorsBackground style-ms5wyvf7__root wixui-button StylableButton2545352419__link" aria-label="Prendre rdv"><span class="StylableButton2545352419__container"><span class="StylableButton2545352419__label wixui-button__label" data-testid="stylablebutton-label">Prendre rdv</span><span class="StylableButton2545352419__icon wixui-button__icon" aria-hidden="true" data-testid="stylablebutton-icon"><span> <svg viewbox="0 0 200 200" height="200" width="200" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <g> 